{end_of_verse}

{column_break}
{start_of_verse: 3}
"Ho[C]sanna [G]in the [Am]high[G]est!"
That [F]ancient [G]song we [C]sing[**]
For [C]Christ is [G]our Re[Am]deem[G]er
The [F]Lord of [G]heaven our [C]King[**]

O [C]may we [**]ever [G]praise [**]him
